/// Remove duplicates from the input vector.
///
/// Returns a new vector with no duplicate elements,
/// preserving exactly the set of input elements.
///
/// # Explanation
/// The output vector contains:
/// 1) No duplicates.
/// 2) Exactly the set of elements from the input vector.
///
/// This is done by iterating over input elements and
/// inserting them into a HashSet for membership checks.
